<title>UK: Takefuji plans international offering.</title>
<headline>Takefuji plans international offering.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Takefuji Corporation's secondary offering of 3.0 million shares will include an international tranche of 2.0 million shares, the issue's global coordinator Daiwa Securities said on Monday.</p>
<p>The remaining 1.0 million shares in the offer, announced in Tokyo, will be issued in Japan where they are traded on the OTC market, Daiwa said.</p>
<p>The joint bookrunners for the international tranche are Daiwa Europe and Morgan Stanley. Bookbuilding for the issue, which may be increased by up to 300,000 shares, begins on March 12, with pricing expected between March 13 and 18.</p>
<p>-- John Sutherland, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7945</p>
